#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/1d82c46209f8648a2df572cfef8ca256f47952566d34386761ab942aa6e50afd.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/1d82c46209f8648a2df572cfef8ca256f47952566d34386761ab942aa6e50afd.avif)\n"
